{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15469","headline":"送彭将军云中觐兄 · 李端","name":"送彭将军云中觐兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻说苍鹰守，今朝欲下韛。\n因令白马将，兼道觅封侯。\n略地关山冷，防河雨雪稠。\n飜弓骋猨臂，承箭惜貂裘。\n设伏军谋密，坑降塞邑愁。\n报恩唯有死，莫使汉家羞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}